SOLUTION: Output customer replies in markdown code blocks to preserve UTF-8 encoding.

## RULE:

When outputting a customer reply (section 6 of RE, or after PR), DO NOT paste it as plain text.

INSTEAD: Wrap it in a markdown code block:

```
Guten Tag Silvana Spajzer,

vielen Dank, dass Sie uns bezüglich der Hardware-Rückforderung...
